From: =?utf-8?q?Lukas_M=C3=A4rdian?= <lukas.maerdian@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:44:35 +0200
Subject: build: rename PAL shared library
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rename the PAL shared library from libpal to libaudioreach-pal across
the Autotools and Android builds, internal dependencies, pkg-config
linker flags, and ABI-check paths.

The generic libpal.so basename is unsuitable for general-purpose
distributions such as Debian: it is not namespace-specific, can collide
with unrelated PAL implementations, and does not identify AudioReach
ownership. The libaudioreach-pal name provides a distribution-safe,
project-specific library identity.

Assisted-by: GPT:gpt-5.6-luna
Forwarded: https://github.com/AudioReach/audioreach-pal/pull/91

Signed-off-by: Lukas Märdian <lukas.maerdian@oss.qualcomm.com>
